{"id":"msg_bdrk_01S6i9gjiN81Tj9SVDWJ5GiH","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to calculate 17 * 23. Let me do this step by step using the standard multiplication method.\n\n17 * 23\n\nI can break this down as:\n17 * (20 + 3)\n= 17 * 20 + 17 * 3\n= 340 + 51\n= 391\n\nLet me double-check this using the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n    17\n  × 23\n  ----\n    51  (17 × 3)\n   340  (17 × 20)\n  ----\n   391\n\nSo 17 * 23 = 391","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll solve 17 × 23 step by step using the distributive property.\n\n**Step 1: Break down 23 into easier parts**\n23 = 20 + 3\n\n**Step 2: Apply the distributive property**\n17 × 23 = 17 × (20 + 3) = (17 × 20) + (17 × 3)\n\n**Step 3: Calculate each part**\n- 17 × 20 = 340\n- 17 × 3 = 51\n\n**Step 4: Add the results together**\n340 + 51 = 391\n\n**Verification using standard multiplication:**\n```\n    17\n  × 23\n  ----\n    51  (17 × 3)\n   340  (17 × 20)\n  ----\n   391\n```\n\nTherefore, **17 × 23 = 391**"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":54,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":368}}559 1742
